  <mj-body background-color="#EEF1F5" width="600px"><mj-section background-color="#001B44" padding="18px 20px"><mj-column><mj-image src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/d3cfa5_95dd8a25863b4556b7ba6398fcfd0316~mv2.webp" width="225px" alt="GatorBait" href="https://www.gatorbaitmedia.com/" padding="0 0 12px"></mj-image><mj-text align="center" color="#ffffff" font-size="23px" font-weight="700" padding="0 0 10px">GatorBait Magazine</mj-text><mj-divider border-color="#FA4616" border-width="2px" padding="0 0 10px"></mj-divider><mj-text align="center" color="#ffffff" font-size="11px" padding="0">SEPTEMBER 23, 2026 · THE BUDDY MARTIN EDITION</mj-text></mj-column></mj-section><mj-section background-color="#ffffff" padding="24px 20px" border-bottom="1px solid #dde3ec"><mj-column><mj-image src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/d3cfa5_0010bf0eca3348adb2b9b24e34d93993~mv2.jpg" width="225px" alt="Jon Sumrall on the Florida sideline at Auburn. Anthony Garro/UAA Communications." href="https://www.gatorbaitmedia.com/post/sumrall-cussing-wife-wants-him-to-stop-buddy-martin?utm_source=gatorbait_newsletter&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=buddy_digest_20260923&amp;utm_content=story_1" padding="0 0 12px"></mj-image><mj-text align="center" font-size="11px" color="#5b6472" padding="0 0 14px">Photo: Anthony Garro/UAA Communications</mj-text><mj-text color="#FA4616" font-size="11px" font-weight="700" padding="0 0 8px">BUDDY MARTIN</mj-text><mj-text mj-class="heading-text" font-size="26px" padding="0 0 12px">Sumrall Cussing: His Wife Wants Him To Please Stop. Damn!</mj-text><mj-text padding="0 0 16px">Buddy Martin on Jon Sumrall’s locker-room language, his wife’s losing battle to stop it, and the tight ends powering Florida’s offense.</mj-text><mj-button href="https://www.gatorbaitmedia.com/post/sumrall-cussing-wife-wants-him-to-stop-buddy-martin?utm_source=gatorbait_newsletter&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=buddy_digest_20260923&amp;utm_content=story_1" align="left" padding="0">READ BUDDY’S COLUMN</mj-button></mj-column></mj-section>
<mj-section background-color="#F8FAFC" padding="24px 20px" border-bottom="1px solid #dde3ec"><mj-column><mj-image src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/ae876a_38f655a52d8b4de98bba87cc30ffa9fb~mv2.png" width="200px" alt="football player" href="https://www.gatorbaitmedia.com/post/jon-sumrall-stayed-home-so-did-his-star-running-back-it-was-a-brilliant-choice?utm_source=gatorbait_newsletter&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=buddy_digest_20260923&amp;utm_content=story_2" padding="0 0 12px"></mj-image><mj-text color="#FA4616" font-size="11px" font-weight="700" padding="0 0 8px">BUDDY MARTIN</mj-text><mj-text mj-class="heading-text" font-size="22px" padding="0 0 12px">Jon Sumrall Stayed Home. So Did His Star Running Back. It Was A Brilliant Choice.</mj-text><mj-text padding="0 0 16px">Buddy Martin on the Christmas Eve visit that helped keep Jadan Baugh at Florida.</mj-text><mj-button href="https://www.gatorbaitmedia.com/post/jon-sumrall-stayed-home-so-did-his-star-running-back-it-was-a-brilliant-choice?utm_source=gatorbait_newsletter&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=buddy_digest_20260923&amp;utm_content=story_2" align="left" padding="0">READ BUDDY’S COLUMN</mj-button></mj-column></mj-section>
<mj-section background-color="#ffffff" padding="24px 20px" border-bottom="1px solid #dde3ec"><mj-column><mj-text color="#FA4616" font-size="11px" font-weight="700" padding="0 0 8px">BUDDY MARTIN</mj-text><mj-text mj-class="heading-text" font-size="22px" padding="0 0 12px">Saturday’s Bill Comes Due: Gators, Ole Miss, and ‘The Promise’ That Started It All</mj-text><mj-text padding="0 0 16px">Nobody needs a sequel to what happened in that locker room. That story already got its ending — a crystal football in January. But there’s something fitting about Ole Miss being the team standing across the line as Sumrall tries to prove his Gators belong with the big boys again. </mj-text><mj-button href="https://www.gatorbaitmedia.com/post/saturday-s-bill-comes-due-gators-ole-miss-and-the-promise-that-started-it-all?utm_source=gatorbait_newsletter&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=buddy_digest_20260923&amp;utm_content=story_3" align="left" padding="0">READ BUDDY’S COLUMN</mj-button></mj-column></mj-section>
<mj-section background-color="#F8FAFC" padding="24px 20px" border-bottom="1px solid #dde3ec"><mj-column><mj-text color="#FA4616" font-size="11px" font-weight="700" padding="0 0 8px">FRANZ BEARD</mj-text><mj-text mj-class="heading-text" font-size="22px" padding="0 0 12px">Thoughts of the Day</mj-text><mj-text padding="0 0 16px">Franz Beard on the echoes of Kerwin Bell in Aaron Philo’s start at Florida.</mj-text><mj-button href="https://www.gatorbaitmedia.com/post/thoughts-of-the-day-september-22-2027?utm_source=gatorbait_newsletter&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=buddy_digest_20260923&amp;utm_content=story_4" align="left" padding="0">READ THOUGHTS OF THE DAY</mj-button></mj-column></mj-section><mj-section background-color="#001B44" padding="20px"><mj-column><mj-text align="center" color="#ffffff" font-size="14px" padding="0 0 10px">Old school journalism + new tech</mj-text><mj-text align="center" color="#ffffff" font-size="13px" padding="0"><a style="color:#ffffff" href="https://gatorbait2026.itemorder.com/shop/home/">Shop hats and visors</a> · <a style="color:#ffffff" href="https://www.gatorbaitmedia.com/pricing-plans/subscribe">Join GatorBait</a> · <a style="color:#ffffff" href="https://www.gatorbaitmedia.com/the-buddy-martin-show">GatorBait TV</a></mj-text></mj-column></mj-section><mj-section background-color="#E4EAF1" padding="20px"><mj-column><mj-text align="center" color="#4B5563" font-size="12px" padding="0">GatorBait Media · GatorBaitMedia.com<br />Reply to brenden@gatorbaitmedia.com</mj-text><mj-text align="center" color="#6B7280" font-size="11px" padding="10px 0 0">You’re receiving this because you subscribed to GatorBait Media. Manage your preferences or unsubscribe using the controls below.</mj-text></mj-column></mj-section></mj-body></mjml>